  <entry>
    <title>IMX6ULL-项目开发 Day 1</title>
    <link href="/2026/05/09/IMX6ULL-%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91-Day-1/"/>
    <url>/2026/05/09/IMX6ULL-%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91-Day-1/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="一、i2c篇-MPU6050和AP3216C外设驱动编写"><a href="#一、i2c篇-MPU6050和AP3216C外设驱动编写" class="headerlink" title="一、i2c篇 MPU6050和AP3216C外设驱动编写"></a>一、i2c篇 MPU6050和AP3216C外设驱动编写</h2><h3 id="1-根据硬件原理图确认硬件信息"><a href="#1-根据硬件原理图确认硬件信息" class="headerlink" title="1.根据硬件原理图确认硬件信息"></a>1.根据硬件原理图确认硬件信息</h3><p>外设挂在哪一条I2C总线上? 设备的7-bit I2C地址是多少? </p><blockquote><p>MPU6050:<br>  总线：I2C1<br>  地址：0x68(0xD0 &gt;&gt; 1)<br>  功能：三轴加速度 + 三轴陀螺仪 + 温度</p></blockquote><blockquote><p>AP3216C：<br>  总线：I2C1<br>  地址：0x1e<br>  功能：环境光 ALS + 接近 PS + 红外 IR</p></blockquote><h3 id="2-修改设备树"><a href="#2-修改设备树" class="headerlink" title="2.修改设备树"></a>2.修改设备树</h3><p>配置pinctrl子系统，在iomuxc节点下增加新的引脚组。在i2c1控制器下增加两个新的节点。</p><figure class="highlight dts"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs dts"><span class="hljs-variable">&amp;i2c1</span> <span class="hljs-punctuation">&#123;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">clock-frequency</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-params">&lt;<span class="hljs-number">100000</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">status</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;okay&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">;</span><br><br>    <span class="hljs-title class_">mpu6050@68</span> <span class="hljs-punctuation">&#123;</span><br>        <span class="hljs-attr">compatible</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;rickyduran,i2c_mpu6050&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">;</span><br>        <span class="hljs-attr">reg</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-params">&lt;<span class="hljs-number">0x68</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">;</span><br>        <span class="hljs-attr">status</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;okay&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-punctuation">&#125;;</span><br><br>    <span class="hljs-title class_">ap3216c@1e</span> <span class="hljs-punctuation">&#123;</span><br>        <span class="hljs-attr">compatible</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;rickyduran,i2c_ap3216c&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">;</span><br>        <span class="hljs-attr">reg</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-params">&lt;<span class="hljs-number">0x1e</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">;</span><br>        <span class="hljs-attr">status</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;okay&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-punctuation">&#125;;</span><br><span class="hljs-punctuation">&#125;;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="3-编写I2C驱动框架"><a href="#3-编写I2C驱动框架" class="headerlink" title="3.编写I2C驱动框架"></a>3.编写I2C驱动框架</h3><p><strong>根据设备树匹配的方式配对设备和驱动</strong>: 注意驱动的compatible字段一定和设备树中的compatible属性值一致，将来设备树加载后节点会被解析在内核中构建设备，一致才能保证设备和驱动正确匹配。</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">static</span> <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">i2c_driver</span> <span class="hljs-title">ap3216c_driver</span> =</span> &#123;<br>    .driver = &#123;<br>        .name = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;ap3216c_raw&quot;</span>,<br>        .of_match_table = ap3216c_of_match,<br>    &#125;,<br>    .probe    = ap3216c_probe,<br>    .remove   = ap3216c_remove,<br>    .id_table = ap3216c_id,<br>&#125;;<br>module_i2c_driver(ap3216c_driver);<br><br><span class="hljs-type">static</span> <span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">of_device_id</span> <span class="hljs-title">ap3216c_of_match</span>[] =</span> &#123;<br>    &#123; .compatible = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;rickyduran,i2c_ap3216c&quot;</span> &#125;,<br>    &#123; &#125;<br>&#125;;<br>MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(of, ap3216c_of_match);<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>mpu6050进行相似的配置</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">static</span> <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">i2c_driver</span> <span class="hljs-title">mpu6050_driver</span> =</span> &#123;<br>    .driver = &#123;<br>        .name = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;mpu6050_raw&quot;</span>,<br>        .of_match_table = mpu6050_of_match,<br>    &#125;,<br>    .probe    = mpu6050_probe,<br>    .remove   = mpu6050_remove,<br>    .id_table = mpu6050_id,<br>&#125;;<br>module_i2c_driver(mpu6050_driver);<br><br><span class="hljs-type">static</span> <span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">of_device_id</span> <span class="hljs-title">mpu6050_of_match</span>[] =</span> &#123;<br>    &#123; .compatible = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;rickyduran,i2c_mpu6050&quot;</span> &#125;,<br>    &#123; &#125;<br>&#125;;<br>MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(of, mpu6050_of_match);<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="4-在probe函数中完成初始化注册-dev节点"><a href="#4-在probe函数中完成初始化注册-dev节点" class="headerlink" title="4.在probe函数中完成初始化注册&#x2F;dev节点"></a>4.在probe函数中完成初始化注册&#x2F;dev节点</h3><p>设备和驱动配对成功后调用probe函数，在probe函数中完成相关初始化操作并注册misc字符设备。<br><strong>芯片初始化相关操作：</strong></p><blockquote><p>AP3216C</p></blockquote><ol><li>写 0x04 到系统配置寄存器，复位芯片</li><li>延时</li><li>写 0x03，开启 ALS + PS + IR</li></ol><blockquote><p>MPU6050</p></blockquote><ol><li>读取 WHO_AM_I，确认芯片响应</li><li>写 PWR_MGMT_1，唤醒芯片</li><li>配置采样率、低通滤波、陀螺仪量程、加速度量程</li></ol><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs C"><span class="hljs-type">static</span> <span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">ap3216c_probe</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> i2c_client *client,</span><br><span class="hljs-params">                        <span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> i2c_device_id *id)</span><br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">ap3216c_dev</span> *<span class="hljs-title">dev</span>;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> ret;<br><br>    dev_info(&amp;client-&gt;dev, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;ap3216c probe, addr=0x%02x\n&quot;</span>, client-&gt;addr);<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (!i2c_check_functionality(client-&gt;adapter,<br>                                I2C_FUNC_I2C |<br>                                I2C_FUNC_SMBUS_BYTE_DATA |<br>                                I2C_FUNC_SMBUS_I2C_BLOCK)) &#123;<br>        dev_err(&amp;client-&gt;dev, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;i2c functionality not supported\n&quot;</span>);<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> -ENODEV;<br>    &#125;<br><br>    ret = ap3216c_hw_init(client);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (ret) &#123;<br>        dev_err(&amp;client-&gt;dev, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;hardware init failed: %d\n&quot;</span>, ret);<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> ret;<br>    &#125;<br><br>    dev = devm_kzalloc(&amp;client-&gt;dev, <span class="hljs-keyword">sizeof</span>(*dev), GFP_KERNEL);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (!dev)<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> -ENOMEM;<br><br>    dev-&gt;client = client;<br>    mutex_init(&amp;dev-&gt;lock);<br><br>    dev-&gt;miscdev.minor = MISC_DYNAMIC_MINOR;<br>    dev-&gt;miscdev.name  = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;ap3216c_raw&quot;</span>;<br>    dev-&gt;miscdev.fops  = &amp;ap3216c_fops;<br>    dev-&gt;miscdev.parent = &amp;client-&gt;dev;<br><br>    i2c_set_clientdata(client, dev);<br><br>    ret = misc_register(&amp;dev-&gt;miscdev);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (ret) &#123;<br>        dev_err(&amp;client-&gt;dev, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;misc register failed: %d\n&quot;</span>, ret);<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> ret;<br>    &#125;<br><br>    dev_info(&amp;client-&gt;dev, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;/dev/ap3216c_raw created\n&quot;</span>);<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">static</span> <span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">mpu6050_probe</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> i2c_client *client,</span><br><span class="hljs-params">                         <span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> i2c_device_id *id)</span><br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">mpu6050_dev</span> *<span class="hljs-title">dev</span>;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> ret;<br><br>    dev_info(&amp;client-&gt;dev, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;mpu6050 probe, addr=0x%02x\n&quot;</span>, client-&gt;addr);<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (!i2c_check_functionality(client-&gt;adapter,<br>                                 I2C_FUNC_I2C |<br>                                 I2C_FUNC_SMBUS_BYTE_DATA |<br>                                 I2C_FUNC_SMBUS_I2C_BLOCK)) &#123;<br>        dev_err(&amp;client-&gt;dev, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;i2c functionality not supported\n&quot;</span>);<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> -ENODEV;<br>    &#125;<br><br>    ret = mpu6050_hw_init(client);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (ret) &#123;<br>        dev_err(&amp;client-&gt;dev, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;hardware init failed: %d\n&quot;</span>, ret);<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> ret;<br>    &#125;<br><br>    dev = devm_kzalloc(&amp;client-&gt;dev, <span class="hljs-keyword">sizeof</span>(*dev), GFP_KERNEL);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (!dev)<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> -ENOMEM;<br><br>    dev-&gt;client = client;<br>    mutex_init(&amp;dev-&gt;lock);<br><br>    dev-&gt;miscdev.minor = MISC_DYNAMIC_MINOR;<br>    dev-&gt;miscdev.name  = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;mpu6050_raw&quot;</span>;<br>    dev-&gt;miscdev.fops  = &amp;mpu6050_fops;<br>    dev-&gt;miscdev.parent = &amp;client-&gt;dev;<br><br>    i2c_set_clientdata(client, dev);<br><br>    ret = misc_register(&amp;dev-&gt;miscdev);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (ret) &#123;<br>        dev_err(&amp;client-&gt;dev, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;misc register failed: %d\n&quot;</span>, ret);<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> ret;<br>    &#125;<br><br>    dev_info(&amp;client-&gt;dev, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;/dev/mpu6050_raw created\n&quot;</span>);<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="5-实现字符设备的相关接口函数-fops函数指针簇"><a href="#5-实现字符设备的相关接口函数-fops函数指针簇" class="headerlink" title="5.实现字符设备的相关接口函数(fops函数指针簇)"></a>5.实现字符设备的相关接口函数(fops函数指针簇)</h3><p>open,read,write,ioctl等接口。</p><h3 id="6-编写App并进行相关测试"><a href="#6-编写App并进行相关测试" class="headerlink" title="6.编写App并进行相关测试"></a>6.编写App并进行相关测试</h3><p>编译设备树和相关模块，配置nfs服务，板卡挂载。替换设备树，加载模块，测试App。</p><h2 id="二、总线模型中驱动的匹配方式"><a href="#二、总线模型中驱动的匹配方式" class="headerlink" title="二、总线模型中驱动的匹配方式"></a>二、总线模型中驱动的匹配方式</h2><h3 id="设备树匹配"><a href="#设备树匹配" class="headerlink" title="设备树匹配"></a>设备树匹配</h3><p>driver中of_match_table字段下的compatible属性值与设备树节点中的compatible属性值进行匹配。</p><h3 id="字符串匹配"><a href="#字符串匹配" class="headerlink" title="字符串匹配"></a>字符串匹配</h3><p>driver中id_table字段下的name属性值与device中的name属性进行匹配。</p><h2 id="三、completion机制"><a href="#三、completion机制" class="headerlink" title="三、completion机制"></a>三、completion机制</h2><h3 id="什么是completion"><a href="#什么是completion" class="headerlink" title="什么是completion?"></a>什么是completion?</h3><blockquote><p>一个执行流需要等待另一个执行流完成某件事<br>Linux内核提供了一种一次性事件同步机制。</p></blockquote><h3 id="核心数据结构和相关api"><a href="#核心数据结构和相关api" class="headerlink" title="核心数据结构和相关api"></a>核心数据结构和相关api</h3><p>核心数据结构</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">completion</span> &#123;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-type">unsigned</span> <span class="hljs-type">int</span> done; ## <span class="hljs-number">0</span> 表示未完成 &gt;<span class="hljs-number">0</span> 表示已完成<br>    <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title">swait_queue_head</span> <span class="hljs-title">wait</span>;</span> ## 等待队列头<br>&#125;;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>相关api</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c">DECLARE_COMPLETION(my_completion); ## 静态定义 / 结构体成员中定义。<br><br>init_completion(&amp;dev-&gt;done); ## 初始化<br><br>wait_for_completion(&amp;dev-&gt;done); ## 等待完成<br>ret = wait_for_completion_timeout(&amp;dev-&gt;done, msecs_to_jiffies(<span class="hljs-number">1000</span>)); ## 超时版本<br><br>complete(&amp;dev-&gt;done); ## 通知完成<br><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
